"""Signal subscription — opt-in consumer for the fleet bus.

This module is OFF by default. Uncomment and configure once {{ worker_id }}
needs to react to signals from other workers.

Usage — add to your scheduled entry-point::

    from {{ package_name }}.signals.subscribe import poll_signals

    def run_scheduled():
        for delivery in poll_signals():
            handle_signal(delivery.signal)

Dedup: always check ``(signal.dedup_key, signal.emitted_at)`` before acting —
the bus delivers at-least-once, so the same signal may arrive on two successive
polls after a cursor-write failure.

See ``docs/signal-bus.md`` in ``clonway-cockpit`` for the full contract.
"""

